---
// writing lives on Substack — single warm card link-out
---

<section id="writing" aria-labelledby="dispatches-title">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2 id="dispatches-title" class="section-head__title">
      Writing
    </h2>
    <span class="section-head__note">DataRiot · Substack</span>
  </div>

  <article class="dispatch reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 200ms;">
    <div>
      <span class="dispatch__kicker">Ongoing series</span>
      <h3 class="dispatch__title">
        Building <em>lore</em> in public.
      </h3>
      <p class="dispatch__deck">
        Ongoing series on building a structure-aware markdown indexer. No
        vectors. No LLM at retrieval. Plus shorter notes on the rest of the
        work.
      </p>
      <a class="dispatch__cta" href="https://substack.com/@DataRiot" rel="noopener">
        Read on Substack
        <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <dl class="dispatch__meta">
      <div>
        <dt>Publication</dt>
        <dd>DataRiot</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Cadence</dt>
        <dd>Irregular</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Subscribe</dt>
        <dd><a href="https://substack.com/@DataRiot" rel="noopener">substack.com/@DataRiot</a></dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </article>
</section>
